"UI_SPEAKER_MARA2": "마라 2",
"UI_SPEAKER_LUKA": "루카",
"UI_SPEAKER_IRIS": "이리스",
"P1_WAKE_LIGHT": "커튼 사이의 아침빛이 눈꺼풀보다 먼저 같은 자리를 밝힌다.",
"P1_WAKE_KNOCK": "[문밖] 레이피어 끝이 바닥에 닿고, 정확히 세 번의 노크가 이어진다.",
"P1_WAKE_EDGAR": "기상 시각입니다, 아가씨. 오늘 일정은 준비되어 있습니다.",
"P1_WAKE_TASKS": "방 안을 확인하신 뒤 나와 주십시오. 대응접실의 창문, 외부 서고의 책, 북쪽 기록 회랑의 초상화를 부탁드립니다.",
"P1_WAKE_OBJECTIVE": "빛과 사물 중 마음에 걸리는 것을 조사해 보십시오."
},
"en-US": {
"P3_NAME_BOOK_MECHANICAL": "Mechanical drawings",
"P3_NAME_BOOK_FLORA": "Greenhouse flora",
"P3_NAME_BOOK_LEDGER": "Dining duty ledger",
"P3_SHELF_CLOCK": "Clock · vertical lines\nMechanical engineering",
"P3_SHELF_FLOWER": "Petals · halo\nPlants and environment",
"P3_SHELF_CUP": "Teacup · double ring\nHousehold records",
"P3_PLACED": "{book}\n[Shelved]",
"P3_INNER_DOOR": "Inner archive glass door\nLocked",
"P3_Q_AUTHOR": "Who wrote this ledger?",
"P3_Q_LOCKED": "Why is it locked?",
"P3_Q_SILENT": "Put it down without a word",
"P3_A_AUTHOR": "These are the master's records.",
"P3_A_LOCKED": "Damaged records are easily misread.",
"P3_SILENT_STATUS": "I put the ledger down without a word. Edgar checks that the clasp is closed.",
"P3_INTRO": "These are the outer library's returned books. Match the spine patterns to the shelf markings.",
"P3_RESTRICTED": "The inner archive is not part of your duties.",
"P3_SELECT": "Drag a book from the inventory on the right to a shelf.",
"P3_WRONG": "The book fits, but its spine does not line up. Compare its pattern with the shelf marking again.",
"P3_DISCOVER": "An old journal falls from inside the return slot. Its cover is illegible, and the ink overlaps as though pushed in one direction.",
"P3_LEDGER": "It is an old research ledger. It is not available for reading at present. I suggest you put it back.",
"P3_HEADER": "Ask about the ledger",
"P3_PROMPT": "Edgar holds out his hand, as if asking me to put the ledger down. What should I ask?",
"P3_RESUME": "The old ledger I could not put down is still in my hands. I cannot read its cover.",
"P3_COMPLETE": "The sorting is complete. Please leave the inner archive as it is.",
"P3_DOOR": "The inner latch resists before the handle does. Instead of a keyhole, the frame has a vertical groove as thin as a rapier blade.",
"UI_INV_EMPTY": "Empty",
"UI_INV_EMPTY_DESC": "Empty inventory slot",
"UI_INV_DRAG_HINT": "Drag onto a target to use",
"UI_INV_DESC": "{item}. Drag onto a target, or select this item and activate the target.",
"UI_INV_SELECTED": "Selected: {item} · drag onto a target or activate the target.",
"UI_INV_DRAGGING": "Dragging: {item}",
"UI_INV_DRY_HINT": "Use the dry side to remove moisture at the bottom",
"P2_TOOL_CLOTH": "Soft cloth",
"P2_TOOL_BRUSH": "Coarse brush",
"P2_TOOL_WATER": "Water bottle",
"P2_TOOL_SPANNER": "Mara 1's spanner",
"P2_TOOL_INTRO": "There you are, my lady! I'll handle the high ones. Could you take these three lower panes?",
"P2_TOOL_GUIDE": "Pick the soft cloth and work down from the dust at the top. No spanners. I nearly tried that myself.",
"P2_TOOL_ALREADY": "This window is already clean.",
"P2_TOOL_SPANNER_FEEDBACK": "The spanner cannot clean the window. Mara 1 hastily reaches out.",
"P2_TOOL_SPANNER_LINE": "Clean with that and you'll open the wall before the window. The cloth, please. The cloth.",
"P2_TOOL_BRUSH_FEEDBACK": "The coarse brush spread the dust sideways. The soft cloth can clear it right away.",
"P2_TOOL_BRUSH_LINE": "My lady, the soft cloth, not that brush! Just gather the scattered dust again, starting at the top.",
"P2_TOOL_WATER_STAIN": "The water loosened the stain. Wipe the moisture below with the dry side of the soft cloth.",
"P2_TOOL_WATER_BOTTOM": "The clean lower area is wet again. Use the dry side of the soft cloth.",
"P2_TOOL_WATER_WRONG": "Water only smears the dirt while dust remains. Clear the dust at the top first.",
"P2_TOOL_TOP_CLEAN": "I gathered the dust downward and cleared the top.",
"P2_TOOL_BIRD": "The same bird crosses the window again, with the same wingbeats.",
"P2_TOOL_BIRD_LINE": "You take your time, but you've got sharp eyes. Don't try wiping that bird away too. ...Just kidding. Probably.",
"P2_TOOL_MIDDLE_ORDER": "Starting lower down made dust fall from above again. Work from top to bottom.",
"P2_TOOL_MIDDLE_CLEAN": "I wiped away the middle stain in circles.",
"P2_TOOL_MIDDLE_ALREADY": "The middle is already clean.",
"P2_TOOL_BOTTOM_ORDER": "Starting at the bottom made dirt fall from above again. Work from top to bottom.",
"P2_TOOL_BOTTOM_CLEAN": "I wiped away the moisture below with the soft cloth's dry side.",
"P2_TOOL_BOTTOM_ALREADY": "The bottom is already dry.",
"P2_TOOL_INVALID": "This item cannot be used to clean windows.",
"P2_TOOL_COMPLETE_LINE": "Spotless! Keep this up and I'll only complain half as much about being short-handed.",
"P2_DRAG": "Drag a tool onto the area you want to clean.",
"P2_INSPECTING": "Inspecting window {index}",
"P2_CLOSED": "Window close-up closed. You can select another window.",
"P2_TITLE": "Window {index} close-up · {state}",
"P2_TOP": "Top\n{state}",
"P2_MIDDLE": "Middle\n{state}",
"P2_BOTTOM": "Bottom\n{state}",
"P2_SPREAD": "Dust spread sideways",
"P2_DUST": "Dust",
"P2_CLEAR": "Clean",
"P2_STAIN": "Stain",
"P2_WET": "Wet",
